{"4088620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Signs and Seasons Explorer", "steam_appid": 4088620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you could travel to any point in history and watch the sky unfold exactly as it did? That’s the idea behind Signs and Seasons—an interactive simulation designed to make sense of something most of us have only experienced passively: the movement of the Sun, Moon, and stars through time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/5e87f1b3ef0dddf70e260c2f6470e928.poster.avif?t=1783114893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/5e87f1b3ef0dddf70e260c2f6470e928.webm?t=1783114893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/5e87f1b3ef0dddf70e260c2f6470e928.mp4?t=1783114893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travelling through time.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overlay graphics on the Earth and Sun.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust scene visuals like lighting and post effects. \t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your vantage point.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your knowledge. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Details</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/316bb3f2c6edf8d25ca90efb5c8b59f3.poster.avif?t=1783114893\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/316bb3f2c6edf8d25ca90efb5c8b59f3.webm?t=1783114893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/316bb3f2c6edf8d25ca90efb5c8b59f3.mp4?t=1783114893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We all experience the sky every day—but very few truly understand it</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why does the Sun rise in a different place in summer than in winter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why do the constellations change over time?<br>Why do “ages” like the Age of Pisces or Aquarius exist at all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These aren’t abstract ideas—they’re patterns you can see once they’re placed in motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signs and Seasons is designed to build that intuition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/62413fb3c4803223f04892c869a6dcbb.poster.avif?t=1783114893\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/62413fb3c4803223f04892c869a6dcbb.webm?t=1783114893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/62413fb3c4803223f04892c869a6dcbb.mp4?t=1783114893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this simulation, you’re not just observing—you’re in control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move forward and backward through years, centuries, and even entire ages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump instantly to any year in history </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how the position of the Sun shifts through the zodiac over thousands of years</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch how the sky changes depending on where and when you are</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/c2281acae93761326ef578f5cb59006d.poster.avif?t=1783114893\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/c2281acae93761326ef578f5cb59006d.webm?t=1783114893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/c2281acae93761326ef578f5cb59006d.mp4?t=1783114893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Instead of memorizing facts, you begin to recognize relationships</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How Earth’s tilt creates the seasons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How orbital motion changes what we see in the sky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long-term cycles shift the backdrop of the stars</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/5757be05c70743f6600f9632fbdb9082.poster.avif?t=1783114893\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/5757be05c70743f6600f9632fbdb9082.webm?t=1783114893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/5757be05c70743f6600f9632fbdb9082.mp4?t=1783114893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There are already tools that simulate the sky with extreme precision</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signs and Seasons focuses on helping you understand what you’re seeing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every system in the simulation is designed to make patterns clearer:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time controls that emphasize meaningful moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simplified relationships that highlight cause and effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal isn’t just realism—it’s insight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/272cdacc2496c3fc03700ba88b20958b.poster.avif?t=1783114893\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/272cdacc2496c3fc03700ba88b20958b.webm?t=1783114893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/272cdacc2496c3fc03700ba88b20958b.mp4?t=1783114893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Think you already know all this? </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your knowledge... it starts easy but how far can you make it? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The learning path goes from simple identification to oppositions to crosses of all ages. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088620/extras/0ce0be203cae8f28606277c691530337.poster.avif?t=1783114893\" widt